== Points of Interest ==
=== Rename Rival ===
After receiving the {{ItemIcon|TOWNMAP}} Town Map from the rival's sister, by talking to her again the player can rename their rival.

=== Inaccessible Grass ===
Patches of grass at the right of the town are inaccessible but contain wild Pokémon data. Every Generation 1 starter Pokémon and their evolutions can be encountered there, as well as there being a 1% chance to encounter Mew.

